nodes.body:
@Oasis-Git this is for the "Enable decoder bounded replay" item on #42170. It lets the cookbook V4.1 launch keep `--enable-decoder-swa-bounded-replay` and still use the breakable prefill CUDA graph. Could you take a look, or point me to the right reviewer?

Two related things:
- #42902 is a small separate fix. On main, `--enable-encoder-swa-bounded-replay` without speculation crashes on the first prefill.
- I also have encoder bounded replay working under the graph on an earlier version of this branch. I will port it to this design and open it as a follow-up once this one has had a first review.

@harmya this also covers the stale tail state from your draft #42078. The replay path now sets or clears the tail for every batch.

